{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nWe are in Brunswick, having arrived at five this morning after a diligence ride from Magdeburg. The Englishman proved useless; our hired coachman vanished, so we were forced into a green-morocco diligence. It was stifling, but the pace was good.\n\nWe visited the museum this morning. The picture gallery is decent, though I must admit I was only looking for the specific painting Schulz mentioned. It is there, and it is merely competent. I paid two thalers for a mediocre lunch; the meat was dry.\n\nI think of Karl and Immanuel. I hope they are well. I will try to find a better coach for the next leg. The heat here is oppressive.\n\nYours,\nHegel"}}],"created":1795218876,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":158,"prompt_tokens":1122,"total_tokens":1280,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-3ovLtOtSr0vSRktUrYKbq5LBnXPc8J7i","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":1122,"prompt_ms":1054.519,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.9398565062388592,"prompt_per_second":1063.9922087700647,"predicted_n":158,"predicted_ms":3677.305,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.42232484076433,"predicted_per_second":42.69431009937985}}